# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# mohallaMitr — Environment Setup
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Each app has its own env files in: apps/<app>/envs/<env>.env
#
#   apps/backend/envs/local.env   — Local MongoDB + MinIO
#   apps/backend/envs/int.env     — Atlas DB + AWS S3 (integration)
#   apps/backend/envs/prod.env    — Production
#
#   apps/mobile/envs/local.env    — Points to localhost:5001
#   apps/mobile/envs/int.env      — Points to localhost:5001 (Atlas backend)
#   apps/mobile/envs/prod.env     — Points to mohallamitr.in
#
#   apps/web/envs/local.env       — Points to localhost:5001
#   apps/web/envs/int.env         — Points to localhost:5001
#   apps/web/envs/prod.env        — Points to mohallamitr.in
#
# ── Quick Start ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#   1. Fill in <placeholders> in the envs/*.env files with your real secrets
#   2. Switch environment:
#
#      yarn env:local    # localhost everything
#      yarn env:int      # Atlas DB + S3, local server
#      yarn env:prod     # production
#
#   3. Start your apps as usual (yarn backend:dev, yarn web, yarn mobile)
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
